  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EU Innovative Action for Private Sector Competitiveness in Georgia is a joint programme that enhances entrepreneurship and business sophistication by strengthening the capacities of the government and local entities to develop and operate clusters. It supports companies directly by providing strategic investments and connecting local businesses to diaspora groups for the purpose of knowledge</narrative>
